            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 6.0</h2>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:0 0 4px">Three ways to work</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Agent, Studio and Nodes.</b> Switch how you work from the bar at the bottom of the window (⌘1, ⌘2, ⌘3). Studio works as before.</li>
<li><b>Agent mode.</b> Work with Paul in a full-window chat. With Work through he finishes multi-step jobs on his own, suggests the right resolution for each video and shows what the chat has cost.</li>
<li><b>Cut.</b> Paul arranges clips, music and sound on a timeline and exports the finished film to your gallery.</li>
<li><b>Nodes mode.</b> Build workflows from model and tool nodes, see the cost of every step before you run it, and run several nodes at once.</li>
<li><b>Media pool.</b> Open a folder to slide its media out next to the chat or the canvas and drag it straight in.</li>
</ul>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:10px 0 4px">Also new</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li>A new title bar with tabs, a choice of accent colours and a name for your agent.</li>
<li>Clearer messages when a usage limit is reached, and easier-to-read secondary text.</li>
<li>Sign-in now asks you to accept the terms of service and the data processing agreement.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
